# Handwritten room rule authoring contract. This file is intentionally not generated by SDK-GEN.
#
# The room host API of room rules (C#'s Room, see unity/Tools/LocalStateMachineKit/REALTIME.md).
# The compiler turns these calls into the room's host calls; Godot never runs them. GDScript
# has no generics or overloads, so:
#   - a @room_schema enum is passed as the first argument where C# has a type argument
#     (define_simulated_prefab(Character) for DefineSimulatedPrefab<Character>()),
#   - the forms that take a numeric prefab ID end in _raw,
#   - enum members are ints, so get_field / set_field / input / after take a schema field,
#     an input slot or a timer either by member (typed) or by number (raw slot).
class_name Gs2Room
extends RefCounted

